---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q5"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: revenue DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   Projection: tpch.tpch.nation.n_name, sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[tpch.tpch.nation.n_name]], aggr=[[sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Decimal128(Some(1),20,0) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)) AS sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |       Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.nation.n_name                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         Inner Join: tpch.tpch.nation.n_regionkey = tpch.tpch.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |           Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.nation.n_name, tpch.tpch.nation.n_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             Inner Join: tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey = tpch.tpch.nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |               Projection: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount, tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 Inner Join: tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_suppkey = tpch.tpch.supplier.s_suppkey, tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey = tpch.tpch.supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   Projection: tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_suppkey, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice, tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                     Inner Join: tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderkey = tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                       Projection: tpch.tpch.customer.c_nationkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                         Inner Join: tpch.tpch.customer.c_custkey = tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                           TableScan: tpch.tpch.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                           Projection: tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderkey, tpch.tpch.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                             Filter: tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate >= Date32("1994-01-01") AND tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate < Date32("1995-01-01")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                               TableScan: tpch.tpch.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey, o_orderdate], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate >= Date32("1994-01-01"), tpch.tpch.orders.o_orderdate < Date32("1995-01-01")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                       TableScan: tpch.tpch.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                   TableScan: tpch.tpch.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               TableScan: tpch.tpch.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name, n_regionkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           Projection: tpch.tpch.region.r_regionkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |             Filter: tpch.tpch.region.r_name = Utf8("ASIA")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |               TableScan: tpch.tpch.region projection=[r_regionkey, r_name], partial_filters=[tpch.tpch.region.r_name = Utf8("ASIA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [revenue@1 DESC]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   SortExec: expr=[revenue@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[n_name@0 as n_name, sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)@1 as revenue]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[n_name@0 as n_name], aggr=[sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([n_name@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[n_name@2 as n_name], aggr=[sum(tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_extendedprice * Int64(1) - tpch.tpch.lineitem.l_discount)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(n_regionkey@3, r_regionkey@0)], projection=[l_extendedprice@0, l_discount@1, n_name@2]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([n_regionkey@3], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(s_nationkey@2, n_nationkey@0)], projection=[l_extendedprice@0, l_discount@1, n_name@4, n_regionkey@5]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([s_nationkey@2], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                     HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(l_suppkey@1, s_suppkey@0), (c_nationkey@0, s_nationkey@1)], projection=[l_extendedprice@2, l_discount@3, s_nationkey@5]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                       RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([l_suppkey@1, c_nationkey@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                         HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(o_orderkey@1, l_orderkey@0)], projection=[c_nationkey@0, l_suppkey@3, l_extendedprice@4, l_discount@5]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                           RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([o_orderkey@1], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                             HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(c_custkey@0, o_custkey@1)], projection=[c_nationkey@1, o_orderkey@2]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                               RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([c_custkey@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                                   DataSourceExec: file_groups={32 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey], file_type=parquet, predicate=true                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                               RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([o_custkey@1], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                                   DataSourceExec: file_groups={32 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey], file_type=parquet, predicate=o_orderdate@4 >= 1994-01-01 AND o_orderdate@4 < 1995-01-01 AND o_orderdate@4 >= 1994-01-01 AND o_orderdate@4 < 1995-01-01 AND DynamicFilter [ empty ], pruning_predicate=o_orderdate_null_count@1 != row_count@2 AND o_orderdate_max@0 >= 1994-01-01 AND o_orderdate_null_count@1 != row_count@2 AND o_orderdate_min@3 < 1995-01-01 AND o_orderdate_null_count@1 != row_count@2 AND o_orderdate_max@0 >= 1994-01-01 AND o_orderdate_null_count@1 != row_count@2 AND o_orderdate_min@3 < 1995-01-01, required_guarantees=[N] |
|               |                           RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([l_orderkey@0], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                             BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                               DataSourceExec: file_groups={32 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount], file_type=parquet, predicate=true AND DynamicFilter [ empty ]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                       RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([s_suppkey@0, s_nationkey@1], 32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                           DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [<redacted>]}, projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey], file_type=parquet, predicate=true AND DynamicFilter [ empty ]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([n_nationkey@0], 32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                       DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [<redacted>]}, projection=[n_nationkey, n_name, n_regionkey], file_type=parquet, predicate=true AND DynamicFilter [ empty ]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([r_regionkey@0], 32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [<redacted>]}, projection=[r_regionkey], file_type=parquet, predicate=r_name@1 = ASIA AND r_name@1 = ASIA AND DynamicFilter [ empty ], pruning_predicate=r_name_null_count@2 != row_count@3 AND r_name_min@0 <= ASIA AND ASIA <= r_name_max@1 AND r_name_null_count@2 != row_count@3 AND r_name_min@0 <= ASIA AND ASIA <= r_name_max@1, required_guarantees=[N]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
